t)\n- the **failure threshold** logic (50% otherwise) is applied and explained\n- **red-flag justifications** are present (IRR > 100%, gross margin > 50%)\n- the model inconsistency is properly documented in the final draft\n\n### What I need from you\nPaste the **full writer-agent draft output** text (all 14 sections with headings), and I’ll rerun the compliance-agent validation and produce the final **risk register** and any required edits.\n\nIf you prefer, tell me where the draft is stored (file path), and I’ll ask for/locate it—right now I only have the summarized content, not the complete draft.	completed	[{"data": {"input": {"todos": [{"status": "in_progress", "content": "Plan 14-section business case workflow (executive summary → appendices)"}, {"status": "pending", "content": "Run research-agent to gather HK market/competitors/regulatory context for the provided project JSON"}, {"status": "pending", "content": "Run finance-agent to compute IRR/NPV@20%/payback/CAGR/sensitivity/KPIs using research output"}, {"status": "pending", "content": "Run writer-agent to draft all 14 required sections"}, {"status": "pending", "content": "Run compliance-agent to validate draft and generate risk register"}]}}, "name": "write_todos", "event": "on_tool_start"}, {"data": {"input": {"todos": [{"status": "in_progress", "content": "Plan 14-section business case workflow (executive summary → appendices)"}, {"status": "pending", "content": "Run research-agent to gather HK market/competitors/regulatory context for the provided project JSON"}, {"status": "pending", "content": "Run finance-agent to compute IRR/NPV@20%/payback/CAGR/sensitivity/KPIs using research output"}, {"status": "pending", "content": "Run writer-agent to draft all 14 required sections"}, {"status": "pending", "content": "Run compliance-agent to validate draft and generate risk register"}]}, "output": "Command(update={'todos': [{'content': 'Plan 14-section business case workflow (executive summary → appendices)',