 {"input": {"query": "Hong Kong digital privacy law PDPO requirements CCTV Wi-Fi app retail experience zone"}, "output": {"id": null, "name": "market_research", "type": "tool", "status": "success", "content": "## Market Research: Hong Kong digital privacy law PDPO requirements CCTV Wi-Fi app retail experience zone\\n\\n### Top Search Results\\n\\n1. **Guidance on the Use of CCTV Surveillance**\\n   Oct 6, 2025 — This guidance provides recommendations to data users (both organisational and individual data users) on the responsible use of. CCTV in ...Read more\\n   Source: https://www.pcpd.org.hk/english/resources_centre/publications/files/guidance_cctv_surveillance.pdf\\n\\n2. **Hong Kong Issues New PCPD Guidance and Leaflets on ...**\\n   Dec 15, 2025 — The PDPO contains exemptions that may permit use of personal data for new purposes without prescribed consent in certain circumstances, ...Read more\\n   Source: https://www.mayerbrown.com/en/insights/publications/2025/12/new-guidance-on-cctv-drones-and-in-vehicle-cameras-in-hong-kong\\n\\n3. **Safeguarding Privacy in a Tech-Driven World**\\n   Nov 17, 2025 — Under DPP1 of the PDPO, data users must ensure that personal data is collected for a lawful purpose directly related to their functions or ...Read more\\n   Source: https://www.hk-lawyer.org/content/safeguarding-privacy-tech-driven-world-pcpd%E2%80%99s-new-guidelines-use-cctv-surveillance-and\\n\\n4. **US tourists in Hong Kong must reveal their device passwords**\\n   Apr 3, 2026 — “It is now a criminal offense to refuse to give the Hong Kong police the passwords or decryption assistance to access all personal electronic ...Read more\\n   Source: https://nypost.com/2026/04/03/lifestyle/hong-kong-police-force-tourists-from-us-to-reveal-device-passwords/\\n\\n5. **Data protection laws in Hong Kong, SAR**\\n   Mar 8, 2026 — The Personal Data (Privacy) Ordinance (Cap. 486) (Ordinance) regulates the collection and handling of personal data.Read more\\n   Source: http