edule Delay\\",\\\\n      \\"Category\\": \\"Schedule\\",\\\\n      \\"Likelihood\\": \\"Medium\\",\\\\n      \\"Impact\\": \\"Medium\\",\\\\n      \\"Mitigation\\": \\"Apply critical-path monitoring; identify and protect schedule float on key milestones.\\",\\\\n      \\"Owner\\": null,\\\\n      \\"Trigger/early warning\\": \\"Missed critical milestones or erosion of schedule float on key workstreams.\\",\\\\n      \\"Residual assessment\\": null\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\"Risk\\": \\"Regulatory / Compliance Change\\",\\\\n      \\"Category\\": \\"Legal/Compliance\\",\\\\n      \\"Likelihood\\": \\"Low\\",\\\\n      \\"Impact\\": \\"High\\",\\\\n      \\"Mitigation\\": \\"Engage regulatory counsel early; monitor government consultations quarterly.\\",\\\\n      \\"Owner\\": null,\\\\n      \\"Trigger/early warning\\": \\"New or proposed regulatory requirements that affect fit-out, signage, or operating conditions.\\",\\\\n      \\"Residual assessment\\": null\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\"Risk\\": \\"Key Personnel Dependency\\",\\\\n      \\"Category\\": \\"Operations\\",\\\\n      \\"Likelihood\\": \\"Low\\",\\\\n      \\"Impact\\": \\"Medium\\",\\\\n      \\"Mitigation\\": \\"Cross-train at least two team members for each critical role; document key processes.\\",\\\\n      \\"Owner\\": null,\\\\n      \\"Trigger/early warning\\": \\"Unplanned absence or resignation of key roles without coverage plans.\\",\\\\n      \\"Residual assessment\\": null\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\"Risk\\": \\"Technology Obsolescence\\",\\\\n      \\"Category\\": \\"Operations\\",\\\\n      \\"Likelihood\\": \\"Low\\",\\\\n      \\"Impact\\": \\"Medium\\",\\\\n      \\"Mitigation\\": \\"Prefer modular, upgradeable technology; include refresh cycle in CAPEX plan.\\",\\\\n      \\"Owner\\": null,\\\\n      \\"Trigger/early warning\\": \\"Mid-project discovery of technology compatibility/performance gaps vs requirements.\\",\\\\n      \\"Residual assessment\\": null\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\"Risk\\": \\"Vendor / Supplier Concentration\\",\\\\n      \\"Category\\": \\"Operations/Financial\\",\\\\n      \\"Likelihood\\": \\"Medium\\",\\\\n      \\"Impact\\": \\"Medium\\",\\\\n      \\"Mitigation\\": \\"Dual-source critical components; negotiate SLAs with penalty clauses.\\",\\\\n      \\"Owner\\": null,\\\\n      \\"Trigger/early warning\\": \\"Supplier lead-time slippage or repeated SLA non-compliance.\\",\\\\n      \\"Residual assessment\\": null\\\\n    }\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\"verdict\\": \\"FAIL\\",\\\\n  \\"missing_inputs\\": [\\\\n    \\"Complete DRAFT BUSINESS CASE content (not a placeholder). Must include the exact 14 required sections with their exact headings and non-empty content.\\",\\\\n    \\"Full financial model outputs needed for rule checks: computed discount-rate usage (20% pre-tax), assessment period (5 years), IRR, NPV (20% check), gross margin %, and failure threshold logic with explicit rationale.\\",\\\\n    \\"The explicit KPI section: KPI names and the KPI set count evidence (for CAPEX HKD5m expected KPI set count = 1, but must verify from the draft).\\",\\\\n    \\"Red-flag sections text and explicit justifications (especially IRR>100% and gross margin >50% if present) rather than acknowledgement-only language.\\",\\\\n    \\"Implication-area sections for financial, legal, tax, and co_sec (including required content for each).\\",\\\\n    \\"Explicit failure threshold statement: what threshold is used and how the 50% logic is applied (per the core rules you listed).\\"\\\\n  ]\\\\n}', tool_call_id='call_E2NApsHK8vXxELSFEn10dfD3')]})"}, "name": "task", "event": "on_tool_end"}]	2026-05-14 15:31:15.474221	2026-05-14 15:34:04.342531
